+
+### Auto-fixed Issues
+
+**1. [Rule 1 - Bug] write_batch vault workaround**
+- **Found during:** Task 2 (seeding phase, before Task 3 checkpoint)
+- **Issue:** MuninnDB v0.3.6-alpha /api/engrams/batch endpoint ignores the vault field, writing all engrams to the default vault instead of zbrain-vault
+- **Fix:** Rewrote write_batch() to use sequential individual POST /api/engrams calls instead of the batch endpoint. Each call correctly includes the vault parameter.
+- **Files modified:** promaia/brain/muninn.py
+- **Verification:** All 32 memories seeded successfully into zbrain-vault (confirmed via MuninnDB Web UI)
+- **Committed in:** d5ea814
