+- Ready for Phase 4.2 (Google Calendar) -- no dependencies on MuninnDB
+- Phase 4.4 (Agent Scheduler) and 4.7 (Info Funneling) can leverage activate tool for cognitive retrieval
+- Embedder issue is non-blocking -- full-text relevance and Hebbian learning still provide value
